#-----------input file for the coupled channel eq code-------------#
#jpi:total parity for (alpha+d),jd:parity for daughter nucleus 
#Sd: spin of d, jt: total J for 2b system, Ed: excitation of daughter nucleus


&channelbeta   beta%jpi=1d0    beta%jd=1d0     beta%Sd=0d0   
               beta%jt=0d0     beta%Ed=0d0                /


&meshs       nr=200       ndiff=1000     rmax=9d0         /


&basisvar    nbasis=5   b=1.6d0   gamma=1.5d0  m=4d0               /


&systems    E=20d0    mass1=1.0078d0    mass2=1.0087d0     
            z1=1d0     z2=0d0                           /


&potentials str='g' v0=-72.15d0   r0=0d0  a=1.484d0            /




